| Adaptive default | Teacher-directed/guided | Guided | Bounded adaptive | Teacher-directed/guided |
| First channel | Tutoring and private schools | Private-school groups | D2C and private schools | NGOs, school networks, telecom/device partners |
| Connectivity design | Low-bandwidth, downloadable | Reliable online with local implementation support | Online, privacy-first | Offline-first and shared-device |
| 2026 investment | Full | Controlled pilot | Full | Partner-led pilot |
| Public procurement | Later | Selective, partner-led | Later, evidence-led | Through funded programs or partners |

