## Brand promise

> **Asian formulation expertise, made relevant to the way Latin America wears, shares, and experiences beauty.**

The company should centralize product quality, brand governance, regulatory discipline, technology, and measurement. It should localize language, shade development, product education, creators, community, payments, fulfillment, and trust-building.

The winning launch will not be the one with the most influencers or the largest opening catalog. It will be the one that makes an unfamiliar brand easy to understand, safe to try, credible in local beauty communities, convenient to purchase, and worth buying again.
