# 13. Country decision summary

| Decision | Mexico | Colombia | Brazil |
|---|---|---|---|
| 2026 posture | Full launch first | Focused creator-led launch | Conditional launch |
| Owned D2C role | Education, CRM, bundles, replenishment | Trust, consultation, retention | Portuguese education, CRM, premium service |
| Marketplace priority | Mercado Libre, Amazon Mexico | Mercado Libre; evaluate additional platforms selectively | Mercado Livre, Amazon Brasil; evaluate Shopee and Magalu |
| Initial categories | Skincare, lip, brows, selected prep products | Lip, eye, brow, demonstrable makeup, selected skincare | Skincare, lip, eye, brow; complexion only after testing |
| Complexion approach | Delay or 12–16 tested shades | Delay or 12–16 tested shades | Delay or 16–24 tested shades |
| Creator emphasis | Routine education and marketplace conversion | Artists, affiliates, live demonstrations | Portuguese creators, professionals, performance proof |
| Payment priorities | Cards, Mercado Pago, installments, cash-network options | Cards, PSE, Nequi, Daviplata, assisted payment | Pix, cards, installments |
| Main incumbent response | Digital convenience plus trusted education | Community, artistry, and human consultation | Local credibility, service, and operational reliability |
| Primary scale gate | Repeat purchase and profitable channel mix | Creator-attributed sales plus retention | Regulatory and fulfillment readiness plus repeat economics |

## Final brand promise

> **Asian formulation expertise, made relevant to the way people in Mexico, Colombia, and Brazil wear, share, and experience beauty.**

The brand should centralize product safety, quality, claims governance, technology, measurement, and brand standards. It should localize product education, language, shade development, creator relationships, payment, fulfillment, service, and community trust.

The launch should be judged not by reach or influencer volume, but by whether an unfamiliar brand can earn informed trial, deliver reliably, generate a second purchase, and do so with a profitable and defensible D2C relationship.
